# The inputs of the mainline RC-10c install images of uc-pxx-installer (KIND=release): RC-10b (mainline-rc10b-install.inputs,
# INSTALLER_COMMIT bf93966) with the RC-10c changes (owner 2026-11-16/17): step 2 takes tsx-autoupdate mode auto as quiet
# too, the panel owns the screen (R31), the copy bar (R32), the unlock as its own step (R26), the rc-service bounds of
# the health gate, the pinned files of slot A, the bind watch of the step-1 service, and step2set = the RC-10c base
# 0.2.0-rc10c-base of uc-pxx-linux uc-pxx-rc10c-int 0466aa7 (manifest 288d132b: uc-pxx-provision 8b22b4e0, uc-pxx-step2
# 56066141, finish.json a1e2d88c naming uc-pxx-step2-finish 71b7a019, uc-pxx-xfer 3262ce29, board.sh 8bcdd92a).
# image/build.sh --install --board both --inputs THIS-FILE, from INSTALLER_COMMIT. Every other value is RC-10b's: the A/B
# tool uc-pxx-bootctl-inst r3 639b6514, the kernel and the tools. The build stops if a value differs. New tokens and
# time (used by no other inputs file). The images are for no unit until the release review names their sha256 and the
# safety rules name the image and the unit.
